# Tomb Dust UI/UX (PyGame client)

**Behavior spec (source of truth):** [`tmp/app-pygame-ui-spec.md`](../../tmp/app-pygame-ui-spec.md)  
**Theme tokens:** [`app/ui/theme.py`](../../app/ui/theme.py)  
**Entry:** [`app/ui/app.py`](../../app/ui/app.py) — window, event loop, layout, thread-safe `_ui_queue`

All `app/ui/**` changes require a backlog ticket ([`tomb-dust-backlog.mdc`](tomb-dust-backlog.mdc)). Update the domain spec changelog when closing.

---

## Architecture

| Principle | Tomb Dust choice |
|-----------|------------------|
| Toolkit | **Custom retained-mode panels** — not `pygame_gui` |
| Frame loop | `clock.tick(60)` → events → `_process_ui_queue()` → scroll momentum → `draw()` → **one** `flip()` |
| Threading | Orchestrator/TTS on worker threads; **only** `_ui_queue.put(...)` from background — main thread drains queue |
| Layout vs render | Rects/anchors in `resize()` / `_layout()`; text → cached surfaces in `_rebuild()` on `_dirty` |

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┬──────────┐
│  NarrationPanel (scroll, rich text)         │ NpcCard  │
│                                             ├──────────┤
│                                             │StatsPanel│
│                                             ├──────────┤
│                                             │ MapView  │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤          │
│  InputBox (text + ≤4 suggestion chips)      │ Sidebar  │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────┴──────────┘
```

**Planned (APP-062):** left **character panel** (Backpack | Spells tabs) — spec in domain spec; not in `app.py` layout yet.

**Config** (`app/config.yaml` → `ui`): `window_width`, `window_height`, `narration_width_ratio` (default **0.7** center / **0.3** sidebar).

