## Component library

| Module | Class | Role |
|--------|-------|------|
| `ui/app.py` | `App` | Layout, events, queue drain, `_enrich_status_for_ui`, turn state, status strip |
| `ui/theme.py` | constants | **All** RGB tokens, voice map, font sizes — import here; no stray literals |
| `ui/rich_text.py` | helpers | Markdown spans, wrap, `render_table` for creation tables |
| `ui/suggestions.py` | `build_player_suggestions` | Code-owned chips; blocklist for `Awaiting:` / enum tokens |
| `ui/panels/narration.py` | `NarrationPanel` | Log, per-voice color, tables, wheel scroll, **tail-follow** |
| `ui/panels/input_box.py` | `InputBox` | `> ` prompt, history, focus ring, suggestion buttons |
| `ui/panels/sidebar.py` | `Sidebar` | Composes NPC + stats + map; resize cache for gate/badge |
| `ui/panels/stats.py` | `StatsPanel` | HP, Fortune, gold, phase pill, **Registry:** badge |
| `ui/panels/map_view.py` | `MapView` | 3×3 AV-GRID, terrain/danger colors, travel block overlay |
| `ui/panels/npc_card.py` | `NpcCard` | Current speaker + TTS pulse |

### Panel contracts

- **`resize(rect)`** — set `self.rect`, mark `_dirty` or re-run child layout.
- **`draw(screen)`** — fill panel bg, 1px `BORDER`, clip children; narration rebuilds when `_dirty`.
- **Engine data** — `StatsPanel.update_from_status`, `Sidebar.update_from_status`, map `update_position` from enriched `status` / `map_update` queue messages.
- **Never** parse `[Phase:…]`, `[Location:…]`, or `Awaiting:` from narration for HUD (APP-035/036/065).

