## Look and feel

### Palette (`theme.py`)

| Token | RGB | Use |
|-------|-----|-----|
| `BG_DARK` | 18,18,24 | Window fill |
| `BG_PANEL` | 24,26,32 | Narration, NPC card |
| `BG_SIDEBAR` | 20,22,28 | Stats column |
| `BG_INPUT` | 32,34,42 | Input bar |
| `BG_BUTTON` / `BG_BUTTON_HOVER` | 44,46,56 / 58,62,74 | Suggestion chips |
| `TEXT_PRIMARY` | 220,218,210 | Body, input text |
| `TEXT_SECONDARY` | 160,158,150 | Labels, chip text |
| `TEXT_MUTED` | 100,98,94 | Hints, placeholders, voice labels |
| `TEXT_ACCENT` | 140,180,220 | Status strip (thinking) |
| `BORDER` / `BORDER_FOCUS` | 48,50,58 / 100,140,190 | Panels / focused input |

**Voice colors** (`get_voice_color`): narrator/gm muted gray; Holt amber; Clerk teal; Sergeant violet; **player** green `(120,200,160)`. Add new canon voices in `VOICE_COLORS` + `VOICE_LABELS` / `VOICE_DISPLAY_NAMES`.

**Mechanical colors:** `HP_GREEN`/`HP_RED`, `FORTUNE_GOLD`, `PHASE_COLORS` (preparation/delve/combat/extraction/surface). **Map-only:** `TERRAIN_COLORS`, `DANGER_BORDER_COLORS` in `map_view.py` — keep terrain local to map.

**Registry badge:** clerk-teal pill `COLOR_CLERK` bg, dark text — prefix **`Registry:`** + `creation_step_display` (APP-036).

### Typography

| Constant | px | Usage |
|----------|-----|--------|
| `FONT_SIZE` | 16 | Body, input, narration |
| `FONT_SIZE_SMALL` | 13 | Labels, map, chips, table cells |
| `FONT_SIZE_HEADING` | 20 | Reserved |
| `FONT_SIZE_STAT` | 24 | HP number |

**Font family:** `pygame.font.SysFont("Consolas", …)` everywhere — monospace TTRPG terminal feel. Create fonts in `_ensure_fonts()` once per panel; **never** per frame.

**Spacing:** `PANEL_PADDING` 12; narration scrollbar `SCROLLBAR_WIDTH` 8; input bar height **50** in `App._layout`.

### Tone

Dark fantasy extraction RPG: restrained chrome, readable prose center-stage, sidebar for **at-a-glance** state. No bright arcade UI; no decorative animation until layout and readability pass playtest.

