## Layout zones (UX)

| Zone | Content | Priority |
|------|---------|----------|
| Center (wide) | Narration + input | Primary — player reads and acts here |
| Right sidebar top | NPC speaker | Contextual |
| Right sidebar mid | Stats + Registry badge | Important persistent |
| Right sidebar bottom | Map | Secondary; **display always**, travel gated |
| Bottom-left of input | Status strip (`thinking` / `speaking` / idle) | Feedback |

**Progressive disclosure:** block map travel during creation (grey overlay + hint); disable submit while `_turn_state == "thinking"`; max **4** suggestion chips.

